{"id":"wb-8-407","name":"国恩寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"国恩寺","text":"国恩寺，又名龙山寺（因其位处龙山），位于广东省云浮市新兴县六祖镇，是一座禅宗寺庙。2019年10月7日公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n国恩寺始建于唐弘道元年（683年），与光孝寺、南华寺鼎足而立，并称“六祖三大祖庭”，为惠能圆寂之所，也是《六祖坛经》的辑录地。2006年12月28日，国恩寺报恩塔地宫遗址发现舍利和珍贵文物。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%BD%E6%81%A9%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":92993909,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92993909","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bae71581811b34d3b50c28ce.jpg","title":"国恩寺_20260527_144925.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%9B%BD%E6%81%A9%E5%AF%BA_20260527_144925.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/%E5%9B%BD%E6%81%A9%E5%AF%BA_20260527_144925.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Pkkj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Xinxing Guo'en Temple","width":320,"height":241},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}